  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px;color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uoz6psH.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"149\"></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\">在这座巨大的监守者主题跑酷挑战中测试你的跳跃技巧！你能到达顶端吗？</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/faiUWfn.jpeg\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\"><br></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">螺旋结构被划分为许多不同的层级。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\">从普通跳跃、栅栏跳跃到梯子跳跃，应有尽有！</span><br></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4bUcvXm.jpeg\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"><br></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/tryzzmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">在 Patreon 上支持我，即可解锁我所有的建筑作品！💎</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qj3YHIU.jpeg\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\">设有检查点，这样你就不必每次都从头开始了。</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">使用条款：</span><br>在 Patreon 订阅<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/tryzzmc/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">钻石等级</a>会员，即可商用我所有的世界地图（请务必附上本页面链接）</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我的免费地图始终允许商用，前提是请附上本页面链接。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
